Package: clinpred
Type: Package
Title: Clinical Prediction Models
Version: 0.4.5
Date: 2026-10-14
Authors@R: person("Victor", "Moreno", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "v.moreno@iconcologia.net")
Maintainer: Victor Moreno <v.moreno@iconcologia.net>
Description: Development and validation of clinical prediction models in
    jamovi, following TRIPOD+AI: discrimination, calibration (in the large,
    slope, ICI), overall performance and clinical utility (net benefit),
    internal validation by bootstrap optimism correction or repeated
    cross-validation, validation in a subset of the data or in an external
    data file (with variable and case-mix checks), sample-size adequacy,
    model updating with the closed testing procedure, variable importance
    (Shapley decomposition of R2, permutation importance, SHAP) and the
    stability of individual predictions; baseline covariates, stepwise or
    elastic net selection, incremental value, and missing data (indicator
    method, single or multiple imputation). Logistic, linear and Cox models,
    and validation of published models.
